flowchart TB
  accTitle: Pequeverso private backoffice access and aggregate operations
  accDescr: The owner or invited operators authenticate through Better Auth OAuth. Server-side session and role checks use the separate PostgreSQL identity database. A bounded server adapter reads private API summaries and optional telemetry. Observability is optional and operator-owned.
  Operator["Owner or invited operator<br/>No public sign-up or domain admission"] --> Access["Server access boundary<br/>Better Auth OAuth · session and role checks"]
  Access --> IAM["PostgreSQL 18 · private IAM<br/>Identity, sessions and invitations"]
  Access --> Panel["Operations dashboard<br/>Health, catalog, runs, latency, tokens and spend"]
  Panel --> Adapter["Bounded server adapter<br/>Private bearer and validated payloads"]
  Adapter --> API["Assistant API · private ops<br/>Summary rev. 1.2 · optional telemetry rev. 1.0<br/>Aggregates, no prompts or buyer data"]
  Panel -. Optional operator integration .-> Ops["vps-ops · private observability<br/>OTLP and metrics · Prometheus and Grafana<br/>No monitoring stack deployed here"]
